Description:
    Regenerates a resource's ReactiveForm and its form views from the model's
    schema and validators. Run it after adding or changing validators so
    live_errors, number-field bounds and requiredness match the model again.

    The model must exist and its table must be migrated. With no field list,
    columns and their order come from the schema; pass fields explicitly only
    to choose a different order or subset — the facts stay the schema's.

    Only the validator-shaped files are rewritten; the rest of the scaffold's
    output is untouched. Thor asks per file before replacing anything you have
    edited. The view layer and css variant are detected from the files a
    previous scaffold left; --phlex and --css override.

Example:
    bin/rails generate hibiki:rails:form Book

    This will rewrite:
        app/forms/book_form.rb
        app/views/books/_form.html.erb
        app/views/books/_book_form.html.erb

    Under --phlex, the views are app/views/books/{form,row_form}.rb instead.
    Pass --skip-views to rewrite only app/forms/book_form.rb.
